  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:56.890" end="01:00.080" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="01:00.080" end="01:02.400" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="01:02.400" end="01:06.010" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="01:06.010" end="01:09.310" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="01:09.310" end="01:11.530" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="01:11.530" end="01:14.490" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="01:14.490" end="01:22.490" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:52.490" end="01:55.770" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="01:55.770" end="01:58.030" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="01:58.030" end="02:01.830" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand</p>
      <p begin="02:01.830" end="02:04.960" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="02:04.960" end="02:07.310" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="02:07.310" end="02:10.920" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people</p>
      <p begin="02:10.920" end="02:14.240" ttm:agent="v1">You think the rules don't apply to the golden boy?</p>
      <p begin="02:14.240" end="02:17.700" ttm:agent="v1">Brilliance makes up for a lot</p>
      <p begin="02:17.700" end="02:24.540" ttm:agent="v1">Don't alienate the only people in the world that understand what you do</p>
      <p begin="02:24.540" end="02:26.220" ttm:agent="v1">One day you might need them</p>
      <p begin="02:26.220" end="02:30.220" ttm:agent="v1"/>
